      "rationale": "Its exact #memberAcc-to-memberVS reachability statement is first proved as MEMBER-SPEC.member-summary using the VERIFICATION-BASE definition, which does not contain this VERIFICATION-MEMBER rule; prove.sh then compiles the rule only for later stages.",
      "source_rule_id": "rule-968e632bd6cc05aaec79ddccf4d7456c3677f8bed85ef5841369f17a2d47bea3",
      "start_line": 41,
      "text": "  rule <k> #memberAcc(V:Val, list(VS:ValSeq))\n    => memberVS(V, VS) ... </k>\n    [priority(40)]"
    },
    {
      "attributes": [
